The organizational chart illustrates the hierarchy of Sasseur REIT. At the top is the **Board of Directors** (red box). Reporting to the Board are the **Audit and Risk Committee**, **Nominating and Remuneration Committee**, and **Sustainability Committee** (blue box). Below the Board is the **Chief Executive Officer** (green box). The CEO oversees six departments (blue boxes): **Investment Management**, **Investor Relations & Capital Markets**, **Finance**, **Asset Management**, **Compliance & Risk Management**, and **Human Resource & Administration**.

